Release weights use the DAFx25 guitar effect-chain corpus, Aachen chapel room
responses, EGFxSet, Guitar-TECHS, and GuitarSet (all CC BY 4.0), plus GuitarJam
(CC0 1.0). IDMT, RemFX, and other restricted research controls are excluded.
No source-dataset audio or room response is included in this repository.

